      "full_text" : "@dss_gabriel @fasterthanlime If you're curious about how this looks in Hylo - https://t.co/1wSkEJIQOU . Some things to note - a consumed argument is marked with `sink.` Int is handled like any other type. Move is implicit, and the value is out of scope after the move (destructive move). Copy is explicit.",
