      "full_text" : "@__phantomderp @martin_uecker @Johnny90VM @AsherMancinelli I'm not proposing general namespaces in C but some inline namespace subset for extern \"C\". This seems like a shame to solve the same problem in another way that pressures C++ to add support for __Alias because it would be required for extern \"C\" operations.",
