      "full_text" : "@kobi_ca @meetingcpp @CppCon Short answer: `find` doesn't guarantee it finds anything. EqualityComparable which makes sameness meaningful was wrongly dropped from requirements, to make floating point \"work\" — because domain of operation for == was wrongly dropped long ago. Bad patch to bad patch!",
