      "full_text" : "@ericniebler @gnaggnoyil @jeremysiek @asutton_ Re: efficiency. We lack facilities to refine concepts and components. A tenant of GP is efficiency is gained through refinement - all the way down to refining for a specific type (only one possible model of the concept). I cannot write my `find()` as a refinement of `std::find()`",
      "lang" : "en",
