      "full_text" : "@ericniebler @gnaggnoyil @jeremysiek @asutton_ GP is even broader. You also have to take into account meaningful models of concepts. There can be a set of implied operations on the models that are not used by any algorithm but are necessary to define the semantics of the model or implied by its (physical) nature.",
