      "full_text" : "@sdowney @Cor3ntin @MichaelCaisse @__phantomderp @tvaneerd As well as making it difficult to build general-purpose libraries. We have axioms for copy and assignment that connect to equality. Those should hold - but they also don't need to be total. The standard has all but forgotten the domain of operations. 6/n",
