      "full_text" : "@sdowney @Cor3ntin @MichaelCaisse @__phantomderp @tvaneerd The general principle is that we associate semantics with syntax. Copy and equality _mean_ something. If you define these operations to mean what you think makes sense for particular use in a particular case, you erode every developer's ability to reason about the code. 5/n",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "SeanParent",
