      "full_text" : "@sdowney @Cor3ntin @MichaelCaisse @__phantomderp @tvaneerd This should be phrased as \"you are only required to be able to destroy or assign to a default constructed regular type.\" Any particular type can, of course, do more. To require _more_ would mean `int` and `T*` are not regular types. 1/n",
