      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@ericniebler I know you understand this, but I've spoken to several developers who did not see that your example is synchronous. I suspect most people will replace futures with senders - and end up serializing much of their code. Don't sell it, teach it.",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "ericniebler",
      "in_reply_to_user_id_str" : "195420581"
