      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@ericniebler I do not know if \"simpler\" is a simpler library or a language extension - I suspect \"simpler\" is also \"more general.\" I wouldn't hold standardization on my suspicions, but I do fear the complexity senders bring to C++ even if I support them.",
