      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@Cor3ntin @blelbach The committee could start with a basic tenant - any new types are Regular unless they represent a relationship, then they are semi-Regular, that would have avoided the std::thread issues, and we'd be able to memoize lambdas because they would be EqualityComparable.",
