      "created_at" : "Sat Mar 27 19:10:46 +0000 2021",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@Cor3ntin @blelbach I find the absence of consistency painful. Physically painful. My latest pain is discovering that std::find() no longer requires EqualityComparable. It is devoid of semantics. I have huge respect for Howard Hinnant and John Lakos, and consider them both friends. 2/n",
