      "created_at" : "Thu Dec 24 01:53:15 +0000 2020",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "With more experimentation, (1) is not true if you have a move-ctor... Not seeing the downside for types where copy is expensive. Tired of people taking my code:\n\nf(g());\n\nand turning it into:\n\nauto x = g();\nf(x);\n\nWhere g() returns a 3GB image... for example",
