      "created_at" : "Sat Dec 12 07:06:28 +0000 2020",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@AlisdairMered @LesleyLai6 There is a proposal for `polymorophic_value` which is what you get if you have proper semantics to copy with a handle. `clone_ptr` fails because copies are not equal. Shared pointer copies the pointer and satisfies all the axioms for copy and equality. Just don't use it.",
