      "full_text" : "@tcanens @BarryRevzin @AlisdairMered @cjdb_ns @PeterSommerlad @lefticus The idea of a partially-formed object permeates the language. What is the state of a local variable `int i;`? What state is required of objects that were being modified to meet the basic exception guarantee? What are the algorithmic requirements of a moved-from object? 5/n",
