      "full_text" : "@tcanens @BarryRevzin @AlisdairMered @cjdb_ns @PeterSommerlad @lefticus So now we are requiring a postcondition of move-from that the value is not in an \"unspecified\" state but a state that is a fixed-point for move operations. If you insist the object is valid then you require that every movable type has a _valid_ fixed point. 3/n",
