      "full_text" : "@AlisdairMered @PeterSommerlad @lefticus You can't \"freely\" use them now unless you know the type and guarantees. \"valid but unspecified\" does not guarantee a single operation because there is not a single operation that is required to have no preconditions for a valid type.",
