      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@PeterSommerlad @lefticus In generic code, name one call you can make. As far as I know, the standard doesn't require any operation to have no preconditions - so for an unspecified value, any operation could be UB. Including destruction. The standard needs a stronger guarantee.",
