      "full_text" : "@botros__fadi Alternative: https://t.co/XLAtPqoX3k\nI've worked in a lot of environments with GC - causes more problems than it solves. Ever product I've seen built with GC at scale expends a huge amount of effort to recycle objects and avoid collection. At that point you might as well write C.",
