      "created_at" : "Thu Jan 03 19:31:07 +0000 2019",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "Also, not as when your doctor is telling you your diagnosis and you have no clue what he is saying. Unless you are a medical professional there is no reason for embarrassment. Also, the way to fix such an embarrassment to is ask, then you can take pride in your new knowledge. \\",
      "lang" : "en",
