      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@gregcons 'n' is an element. Use pre-increment. size() and indices are unsigned. Don't call a function on each iteration.  From you - prefer const :-)\n\nfor (size_t i = 0, n = size(a); i != n; ++i)\nfor (auto f = cbegin(a), l = cend(a); f != l; ++f)\nfor (const auto&amp; e : a)",
