      "created_at" : "Sun Dec 31 21:50:19 +0000 2023",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@ericniebler I also see unnecessary continuation chaining (a _lot_).  I am skeptical about releasing building blocks in the standard before we have sufficient experience with the higher-level constructs they are intended to build.",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "SeanParent",
