      "full_text" : "@adspthepodcast @ninkibah I wrote code in Metrowerks Modula-2 (predates Metrowerks CodeWarrior IDE) and still have my Modula-2 manual. This is why the EoP language is defined with Wirth's EBNF. There was a time when I wanted a Lilith, but it was out of reach. https://t.co/6cvS9SFqoq 3/3",
