      "created_at" : "Mon Oct 15 22:16:44 +0000 2018",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "We still have a tremendous amount of work to do. But under the surface, is not just the heart but the whole body of Photoshop. The code base is singular - the work going into Ps goes into Ps on iPad, and the reverse.\n\nAnd there is so much more I can't talk about yet...",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "SeanParent",
      "in_reply_to_user_id_str" : "399489118"
