      "full_text" : "Part of the story is in the Verge article: https://t.co/IqDmsUE97n\n\nThere were 3 engineers involved with the first \"proof of life\". Myself, Seetha Narayanan, and Michael Kaplan. 4 months before that we had to get a green light to do a proof of concept.",
