      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@ericniebler @tvaneerd @Cor3ntin @PeterSommerlad @antoniomaiorano @AdiShavit @MatRopert @arne_mertz @KevlinHenney @mattgodbolt @cppcast @gregcons Getting the terminology straight. A Range is anything denoting a half open interval and doesn't make any additional requirements on copy/equality. A View is a half open interval. How then is Span a View? How can a View not require Regular?",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "ericniebler",
