      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@ericniebler @tvaneerd @Cor3ntin @PeterSommerlad @antoniomaiorano @AdiShavit @MatRopert @arne_mertz @KevlinHenney @mattgodbolt @cppcast @gregcons By \"span is a Range and a View\" you of course mean it is neither, since something cannot be both. I think this is an instance were we need user defined reference types. i.e. `class span : public &amp;`. It seems to be range&amp;. (My use of range was the \"classic\" term, now view).",
