      "full_text" : "@tvaneerd @Cor3ntin @PeterSommerlad @antoniomaiorano @AdiShavit @MatRopert @arne_mertz @KevlinHenney @mattgodbolt @cppcast @gregcons The short story of how EoP happened...\nAlex: \"Nobody understands what I've been trying to do...\"\nGreg Gilley: \"How could they? You never wrote it down.\"\nAlex: Starts EoP...\n\nI'm somewhat optimistic. Not just C++, but the industry has been generally moving in a positive direction.",
